OL,3,GNEWSAHMOs 'targeted' as 25 incidents of
OL,4,Avandalism linked
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating 25 linked
OL,7,Fincidents of criminal damage across
OL,8,FSalford and believe houses in multiple
OL,9,Foccupation (HMOs) are being targeted.
OL,11,FThe incidents, including smashed
OL,12,Fwindows, vandalism and graffiti, have
OL,13,Fbeen reported since 5 October and each
OL,14,Fincident follows a similar pattern of
OL,15,Foffending, Greater Manchester Police
OL,16,F(GMP) said.
OL,18,FThe force said the attacks on homes
OL,19,Fwere in different parts of the city but
OL,20,Fthey were currently being treated as
OL,21,Flinked.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
